OL,3,GNEWSAJLR is 'jewel in the crown' of UK
OL,4,Aeconomy, says PM
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has
OL,7,Fdescribed Jaguar Land Rover (JLR) and
OL,8,Fthe West Midlands automotive sector as
OL,9,Fthe "jewel in the crown" of the UK
OL,10,Feconomy.
OL,12,FSpeaking to BBC Politics West Midlands,
OL,13,FBurnham insisted mass car production
OL,14,Fstill had a future in the UK and said
OL,15,Fthe government was working with the EU
OL,16,Fto ensure new rules did not
OL,17,Fdisadvantage British manufacturers.
OL,19,FJLR has called for government help to
OL,20,Fmove into aerospace and defence,
OL,21,Fwarning that car production faced a
OL,22,Flong-term decline.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
