OL,3,GNEWSAJLR is 'jewel in the crown' of UK
OL,4,Aeconomy, says PM
OL,5,
OL,6,FBurnham said he would take the concerns
OL,7,Fseriously but that his priority
OL,8,Fremained helping the automotive
OL,9,Findustry continue.
